[h2][color=#D4AF37]Credits[/color][/h2]

Embers of Empire combines original work with adapted or foundational material from other Roman-flavour projects. Credit remains with the original creators for their respective work.

[list]
[*][b]The Fallen Eagle:[/b] cultural and Roman-restoration foundations, icons, and province-restoration concepts
[*][b]Roma Invicta (@skela):[/b] Born in Red framework for children of emperors residing in Rome
[*][b]Better Roman Empire Map (@洛山达的法师):[/b] western reconquest event-chain foundations
[*][b]True Romans (@Adaelaetus):[/b] icons
[*][b]Traits of the Greek Gods (@Caracus):[/b] Roman-flavoured demi-god traits
[*][b]More Holding Graphics (@Scratchmen):[/b] unique holding graphics
[*][b]Lux Renata (@Cameron122 and team):[/b] Roman and Hellenic coat of arms material
[/list]

[h2][color=#D4AF37]Support And Community[/color][/h2]

Found a province that refuses to rejoin Rome, a decision that has vanished, or a monument behaving strangely? Include your CK3 version, full mod list, exact load order, whether the campaign was newly started, and any relevant error logs.

